  "description": "Google Cloud provider for SourceFlow.Net. Implements command dispatching and event publishing via Google Cloud Pub/Sub (topics and pull subscriptions). Features include automatic bus bootstrapping as an IHostedService that provisions topics and subscriptions at startup, Cloud KMS envelope encryption, configurable retry policies, health checks for the Pub/Sub endpoint, the Pub/Sub emulator for local development, and OpenTelemetry metrics. Supports .NET 8.0, 9.0, and 10.0.",
  "iconFile": "event-icon.png",
